  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She knew I would see it and would send you to stop it, just as her fleets scour the seas for other relics - red herrings, decoys to draw my gaze.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_039.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will need to adjust my thinking, try to to deduce what she really wants-",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_040.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The dais? Oh, yes, those upon it are trapped there, fuel for the Storm Engine. It feeds on resentment, bitterness and hatred.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_041.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know you want to free them, but we - no, do what you must. You will need the Circuit Runes scattered across the island to repair the Control Wall.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_042.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But the storm itself will alter your path according to the temperament of its hosts. Approach the dais to see for yourself.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_043.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1779136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-STORM-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This first path will lead you to a maze of ruins. Use your Calescent Tracker to find your way.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-STORM_044.mp3",
